{'symbol': 'LHX', 'date': '2021-12-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'L3HARRIS ELECTS FORMER US AMBASSADOR AND COMMANDER OF US PACIFIC COMMAND ADMIRAL HARRY B. HARRIS, JR. (RET.', 'text': 'MELBOURNE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--L3HARRIS TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE:LHX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ADMIRAL HARRY B. HARRIS, JR., U.S. NAVY (RET.) – FORMER U.S. AMBASSADOR TO THE REPUBLIC OF KOREA AND COMMANDER OF THE U.S. PACIFIC COMMAND – HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS. HIS ADDITION EXPANDS THE L3HARRIS BOARD TO 13 MEMBERS. ADMIRAL HARRIS, 65, SERVED AS U.S. AMBASSADOR TO THE REPUBLIC OF KOREA FROM 2018 TO 2021, WORKING CLOSELY WITH LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANIES TO PROMOTE INNOVATION AND COLLA'}